<title>USA: Georgetown University outlook negative - Moody's.</title>
<headline>Georgetown University outlook negative - Moody's.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said it has confirmed the A1 ratings on Georgetown University's long-term general obligation debt, but has changed its outlook for potential change in the rating over the intermediate term to negative from stable.</p>
<p>This outlook change was percipitated by the recent announcement of accelerating losses at Georgetown's Medical Center.</p>
</text>
